			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				356,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Add architectural documentation for the abstract core library\n\nIntroduce `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` to formally define the Common crate's role as the pure abstraction layer for the Land editor's Rust backend. The document details the ActionEffect declarative system, trait-based dependency injection, universal error handling via `CommonError`, and the full service domain map covering 25+ capabilities.\n\nThis establishes a comprehensive reference for the contract-first design principles used by Mountain, Air, Echo, and other downstream consumers, ensuring clarity on the separation between abstract definitions and concrete implementations.",
			"SHA": "11c98b5af93913fa9bd9ac1b639709c6f99b9794"
		},
